00:03:07.151 --> 00:03:11.920
It would be like Huntress, Laurel and Felicity
teaming up. But anyone who hasn't gotten their

00:03:11.920 --> 00:03:15.540
head chopped off is fair game for them to
bring back. Not just Huntress.

00:03:15.540 --> 00:03:19.870
Question 5 - Gerry Do you think they’d ever
jump forward in time between seasons in the

00:03:19.870 --> 00:03:21.940
future. Like fast forward.

00:03:21.940 --> 00:03:27.480
No, just talking about story devices, I think
Arrow has made flashbacks their thing for

00:03:27.480 --> 00:03:33.120
better or worse. If we do see Flash Forwards,
I think it will be via The Flash. Since Zoom

00:03:33.120 --> 00:03:37.290
is a character that moves around in time a
lot. Plus Goeff Johns is writing on the show.

00:03:37.290 --> 00:03:39.790
Remember how he wrote the Legion episode of
Smallville?

00:03:39.790 --> 00:03:43.600
They could always do something similar on
the Flash. Where Barry Allen interacts with

00:03:43.600 --> 00:03:47.710
the Legion of Superheroes. I wouldn't expect
something like that in season 1 though.

00:03:47.710 --> 00:03:52.790
Question 6 - Dontforget asks Can you do a
video saying what you think the writers could

00:03:52.790 --> 00:03:55.720
do to make season 3 better than season 2?
﻿

00:03:55.720 --> 00:04:00.650
Ooh, that's gonna be tough. Right now they
have a few advantages that I think will help.

00:04:00.650 --> 00:04:04.840
Team Arrow is at a low point. Even though
they defeated Slade, the collateral damage

00:04:04.840 --> 00:04:09.380
was off the charts. So they have to go into
rebuilding mode. Oliver has to get his company

00:04:09.380 --> 00:04:13.150
back, rebuild his fortune so they can buy
more cool toys.

00:04:13.150 --> 00:04:18.000
They have to build out the new Arrowcave,
they have to integrate A newly super powered

00:04:18.000 --> 00:04:22.211
Barry Allen into the team. I am counting Barry
as a member of Team Arrow this year, even

00:04:22.211 --> 00:04:26.240
if he isn't around all the time. He is officially
part of the ever growing family.

00:04:26.240 --> 00:04:31.720
So what a lot of professional sports teams
do in rebuilding years is focus on fundamentals.

00:04:31.720 --> 00:04:37.020
So I think we'll see Oliver doing another
Rocky style training montage as he slowly

00:04:37.020 --> 00:04:41.790
builds a stronger platform for the Team. Metaphorically
speaking.

00:04:41.790 --> 00:04:45.680
The series takes a lot of it's story cues
from Christopher Nolan's Dark Knoght Trilogy,

00:04:45.680 --> 00:04:50.250
but I don't think we're going to see a Dark
Knight Rises batman arc for him. That would

00:04:50.250 --> 00:04:52.990
be a story they'd do if they ever ended the
series.

00:04:52.990 --> 00:04:58.350
Question 7 - Ricardo asks do you think Solomon
Grundy could be the villain for season 3?

00:04:58.350 --> 00:05:02.030
We could totally see Grundy again. We don't
really know what happened to him after last

00:05:02.030 --> 00:05:07.100
