00:05:08.100 --> 00:05:13.620
Question 8 - Supergamelord asks What if they
build a smallville Clark/Lex relationship

00:05:13.620 --> 00:05:17.270
between Barry/Eddie﻿?

00:05:17.270 --> 00:05:23.350
I definitely think they're going to have a
'ship of sorts. But I think Thawne is going

00:05:23.350 --> 00:05:28.680
to already know Barry is The Flash. There's
a couple things going on with the character.

00:05:28.680 --> 00:05:34.580
I think they basically combined Eobard Thawne
and Hunter Zolomon. Eobard came from the future

00:05:34.580 --> 00:05:37.570
and Zolomon worked with Barry at the police
station.

00:05:37.570 --> 00:05:42.540
The only reason Eddie would have for killing
Barry's mother is because he knew Barry would

00:05:42.540 --> 00:05:46.980
become the Flash someday. Which means he had
to come from the future. So the Clark/Lex

00:05:46.980 --> 00:05:50.840
frenemies dynamic will be very different.
But they'll be working in the same building,

00:05:50.840 --> 00:05:53.370
